  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "While in VR, look at an extreme angle (e.g. downwards and to the left/right) while clicking on a station to enter it, or using something in a world that will send you into a station.\n\nYour perspective will be at an angle permanently while you are in the seat unless you exit and re-enter while looking directly ahead.\n\nThis can also be caused in Desktop mode if you enter a seat from another seat with your head at an angle in the same way.\n\nIn my in-development world, you are sent into a car after selecting your race options. Try looking down and to the left or right while you are selecting them to see how your perspective is broken when you get sent to the vehicle:\n\nhttps://vrch.at/48dt9wjq",
